Subject: [PATCH 3/3] contrib/attestation/package-builder: vendored third-party sources

Base:   NixOS/nix 0765ffa540e2adfda7b69efafdbac821ebc48034
        (master, 2026-09-04, "Merge pull request #16340 from JamieMagee/fuzz/seed-replay")
Source: nix-tee/nix-fork/nix-src (branch feature/tee-attestation)

Adds the third-party sources the package builder uses offline: jo 1.7,
GNU config.guess/config.sub, busybox 1.36.1 and unzip 6.0 tarballs, and
CVE patches for busybox and unzip. Contains binary files.

Apply with: git apply <patch>   (GNU patch cannot apply the binary hunks)

Apply from the root of a NixOS/nix checkout at the base commit.
See README.md next to this file for the file list and caveats.
